			title: "Atomic Fission Is a Separate Tier"
			description: ["The Fission Chamber Controller performs generic atomic decomposition. Matterworks replaces its stock entry recipe and requires NuclearCraft ring-accelerator control hardware, so this machine belongs to the late atomic-engineering program rather than ordinary chemistry."]
